pe":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AptabaseEncoding\/documentation\/AptabaseEncoding\/AptabaseEncodingError","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AptabaseEncodingError"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations/BatchEncoder":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/batchencoder","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BatchEncoder"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"What turns a batch of records into the requests ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination"},{"text":" sends.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BatchEncoder"}],"title":"BatchEncoder"},"doc://AptabaseEncoding/documentation/AptabaseEncoding/AptabaseBatchEncoder/transientStatuses":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AptabaseEncoding\/documentation\/AptabaseEncoding\/AptabaseBatchEncoder\/transientStatuses","url":"\/documentation\/aptabaseencoding\/aptabasebatchencoder\/transientstatuses","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transientStatuses","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"TransientStatus","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations15TransientStatusV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The status Aptabase answers that "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" retries, beside 408, 429 and every 5xx:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"418, which Aptabase answers when a request’s body arrives slower than 60 bytes a second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after a 10-second grace period, as over a poor connection."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"transientStatuses"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Sensitive":{"url":"\/documentation\/events\/sensitive","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Sensitive","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A property value that a destination reads only through the record it arrived in, and not at all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"once the record is redacted."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://AptabaseEncoding/documentation/AptabaseEncoding/HTTPDestinations/HTTPDestination/aptabase(appKey:host:isDebug:plan:backoff:clock:now:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/aptabaseencoding\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination\/aptabase(appkey:host:isdebug:plan:backoff:clock:now:)","title":"aptabase(appKey:host:isDebug:plan:backoff:clock:now:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"aptabase"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"appKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"host"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV","text":"URL"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isDebug"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"plan"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4P